WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.533 --> 00:00:03.302
- BUT BABE, MOVING OUT?

00:00:03.335 --> 00:00:06.239
PLEASE, THIS
IS THE WORST POSSIBLE TIME.

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:08.341
PLEASE DON'T DO THIS.

00:00:08.374 --> 00:00:09.642
BABE?

00:00:09.675 --> 00:00:14.514
[sighs]

00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:17.316
- GARBAGE.
- HUH?

00:00:17.349 --> 00:00:18.518
- CAN I TAKE YOUR GARBAGE?

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:21.721
- YEAH, SURE.

00:00:21.754 --> 00:00:23.423
- [chuckles]

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:28.528
YOU KNOW, I FIND
THE MORE GARBAGE IN THE CAN

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:33.800
THE BETTER IT FEELS
TO DUMP IT ALL OUT.

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.069
I SUPPOSE THAT'S
WHY WE LET IT GET SO FULL

00:00:36.102 --> 00:00:40.273
IN THE FIRST PLACE.

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:43.243
SO WE CAN START OVER.

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:51.284
- HERE TO FIX THE COPIER.
- YEAH, SURE, SURE.

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:52.685
HEY, HOW DID YOU--

00:00:52.718 --> 00:00:55.521
- SOMETIMES THINGS
AIN'T REALLY BROKEN.

00:00:55.554 --> 00:00:57.557
IT'S THE WAY
WE TREAT 'EM

00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:00.693
THAT NEEDS TO BE FIXED.

00:01:00.726 --> 00:01:04.097
[machine starts]

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:08.468
HEH.
[whistles]

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:13.573
[chuckles]

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:15.308
- WHO THE HELL
ARE YOU GUYS?

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:19.846
both: THE IMPORTANT QUESTION
IS WHO ARE YOU, STEVE?

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:22.548
[ominous music]

00:01:22.581 --> 00:01:26.686
- WELL, IF IT
ISN'T MR. STANLEY.

00:01:26.719 --> 00:01:29.455
- CARL.

00:01:29.488 --> 00:01:32.358
[ominous music continues]

00:01:32.391 --> 00:01:33.893
♪ ♪

00:01:33.926 --> 00:01:37.363
- YOU NEED TO FIND
YOUR OWN TROUBLED WHITE BOY.

00:01:43.435 --> 00:01:46.439
- I WAS HERE FIRST.

00:01:51.777 --> 00:01:52.879
COPYCAT!

00:01:52.912 --> 00:01:56.516
- AAGH!
[coughs]

00:01:56.549 --> 00:01:58.384
[heavy breathing]

00:01:58.417 --> 00:01:59.752
SWEEP THIS...

00:01:59.785 --> 00:02:01.254
BITCH!

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:03.222
- HUNH!

00:02:03.255 --> 00:02:07.260
- [chuckles]

00:02:09.895 --> 00:02:11.230
UH-OH.
- HAH!

00:02:11.263 --> 00:02:13.366
- WHOA! UNH!
[groans]

00:02:13.399 --> 00:02:15.301
- [chuckles]

00:02:29.315 --> 00:02:30.783
- DAMN!

00:02:30.816 --> 00:02:31.851
CHESTERFIELD!

00:02:31.884 --> 00:02:35.555
[whistles]

00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:37.723
both:
THERE CAN BE ONLY ONE

00:02:37.756 --> 00:02:40.393
MAGICAL NEGRO!

00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:43.296
HUNH!

00:02:46.832 --> 00:02:49.735
[intense opera music]

00:02:49.768 --> 00:02:56.809
♪ ♪

00:02:56.842 --> 00:03:01.547
- [wild whistling]

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:04.350
both: YAARRGH!

00:03:19.732 --> 00:03:21.567
- GOOD LORD.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:24.904
ARE YOU ALL RIGHT?

00:03:24.937 --> 00:03:30.376
WELL, I GUESS SOMETIMES
THINGS HAVE TO COME APART

00:03:30.409 --> 00:03:33.379
BEFORE WE CAN PUT
'EM BACK TOGETHER AGAIN.

00:03:33.412 --> 00:03:37.383
- OH, YOU'RE
A MAGICAL NEGRO TOO.

00:03:37.416 --> 00:03:39.919
- WHO YOU CALLIN' "NEGRO,"
BITCH?

